      "id": "deadly.room-collapsed-ceiling",
      "category": "deadly-encounter",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "Stone and metal have collapsed across the chamber.\n\nBroken slabs hang at impossible angles while debris chokes the passages beneath them. Every step must be chosen carefully, and what remains of the ceiling offers uncertain shelter from incoming fire.\n\nMovement through this room will be slower.",
