      "category": "deadly-encounter",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "The light dies as you enter.\n\nBeyond a few meters, the chamber disappears into absolute black. Shapes become shadows, distances become uncertain, and even the metallic walls of the tomb seem to vanish into the void.\n\nWhatever waits beyond the darkness is hidden from sight.",
      "scriptHash": "4d9da34b770fc78bbb508a3212b726ce74f1ed3813b8f75d3ec79dd096c9bcbb",
      "outputFile": "deadly-encounters/rooms/darkness.mp3",
