      "id": "deadly.room-corrosive-fluid-leak",
      "category": "deadly-encounter",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "Something is leaking into the chamber.\n\nHissing liquid spills from ruptured conduits and spreads across the floor, eating into anything it touches. Only the shelter of the walls offers any protection from the corrosive spray.\n\nRemaining exposed here will be dangerous.",
