      "category": "deadly-encounter",
      "status": "generated",
      "script": "Warning indicators flare.\n\nAn invisible contaminant hangs in the air, released from systems sealed for untold millennia. Breathing becomes difficult. Muscles hesitate. Even simple actions demand an effort they did not moments before.\n\nSomething in this room is fighting you from within.",
